# Exclude dependency and build outputs from Docker context
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.vercel

# Git and editor junk
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.DS_Store

# Local env and runtime files
.env*
*.local
/tmp
logs
